            <div class="offering-body">

              <h2 id="sanitizing">Fresh Water Tank Sanitizing</h2>

              <!-- Original wording
<p>When your RV sits idle for weeks/months, mold can develop in the fresh water tank and possibly in the

                pipes.

                This could potentially be a health risk. I will sanitize your fresh water system according to

                recommendations and instructions from

                your RV manufacturer.</p>
-->
              <p>Fresh water systems need periodic sanitizing, particularly after extended storage. I sanitize your
                RV&rsquo;s fresh water tank and plumbing using the applicable manufacturer&rsquo;s instructions to help
                you prepare for your next trip.</p>

              <div class="offering-price"><rv:price regular="169" discount="<%= GRAND_OPENING_PERCENT %>" /> </div>

